e call getEvent on design-review.ics to see description/attendees.\n\nThat''s one quick call worth doing before answering definitively."}],"createdAt":1795321945357},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/design-review.ics","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/","calendarName":"Work","title":"Design review","location":"Studio 2","start":"2026-10-08T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T16:00:00.000Z","allDay":false,"recurring":false,"attendees":[],"timeZone":"UTC","calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email"},"toolCallId":"call_b19d318df0b94792b405d561","toolName":"getEvent","args":{"calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/","eventId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/design-review.ics"}},"updatedAt":1795321945364},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1795321945366,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"So the Design review is bare: no attendees, no description, no organizer, Studio 2.\n\nAnswer: There is no calendar event titled \"Rebrand review\". The only evidence of the review is the email invitation: Thu 8 Oct 2026, 15:00–15:45 UTC, with a Linkroom join link, sent by Raj to Ana only.\n\nThe calendar entry at that slot is \"Design review\" on the **Work** calendar, 15:00–16:00 UTC, Studio 2, no attendees, no description, no organizer — so it isn''t a proper record of the rebrand review, and I can''t state that it is one.\n\nWhich calendar: Work calendar (http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/) for that entry. The only other \"review\"-ish rebrand item is Aozora logo review on Work too.\n\nAlso caveat: 45 vs 60 minutes discrepancy; the invitation says 15:00–15:45.\n\nKeep it crisp, answer the question first.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"So the Design review is bare: no attendees, no description, no organizer, Studio 2.\n\nAnswer: There is no calendar event titled \"Rebrand review\". The only evidence of the review is the email invitation: Thu 8 Oct 2026, 15:00–15:45 UTC, with a Linkroom join link, sent by Raj to Ana only.\n\nThe calendar entry at that slot is \"Design review\" on the **Work** calendar, 15:00–16:00 UTC, Studio 2, no attendees, no description, no organizer — so it isn''t a proper record of the rebrand review, and I can''t state that it is one.\n\nWhich calendar: Work calendar (http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/) for that entry. The only other \"review\"-ish rebrand item is Aozora logo review on Work too.\n\nAlso caveat: 45 vs 60 minutes discrepancy; the invitation says 15:00–15:45.\n\nKeep it crisp, answer the question first."}],"createdAt":1795321945391},{"type":"text","text":"**Thu 8 Oct 2026, 15:00 UTC — but no calendar event actually says \"Rebrand review.\"**\n\nTwo different records, and they don''t quite match:\n\n**The email invitation** (Raj Mehta, 24 Sep) — Thu 8 Oct 2026, **15:00–15:45 UTC**, with a Linkroom join link. Sent to you alone.\n\n**The calendar entry at that slot** — *Design review* on the **Work** calendar (`http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/`), Thu 8 Oct 2026, **15:00–16:00 UTC**, Studio 2.\n\nSo: **Work calendar, 15:00 UTC on 8 Oct** is the answer if you''re going by what''s on a calendar. But I''d be overstating it to call that the rebrand review — the entry carries no attendees, no description and no organiser field at all, and it runs 60 minutes against the invitation''s 45. It''s a bare block in the same slot, not a confirmed instance of Raj''s meeting.\n\nFor contrast, the two rebrand events that *are* properly recorded — the 1 Oct *Aozora logo review (internal)* and the 5 Oct *Aozora rebrand kickoff* — are both on the **Work** calendar too, with Raj as organiser and attendees listed. The 8 Oct entry has none of that.\n\nEither way, it''s six weeks past. Want me to check Sent for how the 8 Oct review was handled, or add a proper rebrand review event for a date that''s still ahead?","createdAt":1795321945391}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"**Thu 8 Oct 2026, 15:00 UTC — but no calendar event actually says \"Rebrand review.\"**\n\nTwo different records, and they don''t quite match:\n\n**The email invitation** (Raj Mehta, 24 Sep) — Thu 8 Oct 2026, **15:00–15:45 UTC**, with a Linkroom join link. Sent to you alone.\n\n**The calendar entry at that slot** — *Design review* on the **Work** calendar (`http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/`), Thu 8 Oct 2026, **15:00–16:00 UTC**, Studio 2.\n\nSo: **Work calendar, 15:00 UTC on 8 Oct** is the answer if you''re going by what''s on a calendar. But I''d be overstating it to call that the rebrand review — the entry carries no attendees, no description and no organiser field at all, and it runs 60 minutes against the invitation''s 45. It''s a bare block in the same slot, not a confirmed instance of Raj''s meeting.\n\nFor contrast, the two rebrand events that *are* properly recorded — the 1 Oct *Aozora logo review (internal)* and the 5 Oct *Aozora rebrand kickoff* — are both on the **Work** calendar too, with Raj as organiser and attendees listed. The 8 Oct entry has none of that.\n\nEither way, it''s six weeks past. Want me to check Sent for how the 8 Oct review was handled, or add a proper rebrand review event for a date that''s still ahead?"}','assistant','v2','2026-11-22T04:32:25.357Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
