 has been on every Aozora cup since 1962.*\n>\n> Budget: JPY 1,850,000, agreed in the signed proposal.\n\nTwo things worth your attention:\n\n**It settles the earlier ambiguity.** The brief puts the first review at 8 Oct, 15:00 UTC — which matches both Raj''s emailed invitation and the otherwise-bare *Design review* block on the Work calendar. That block is the rebrand review; the brief is what ties it together.\n\n**And it gives you a live deadline.** *Final files: 2026-11-20* — **five days from today**, and there''s no calendar entry anywhere for it. That''s now the most urgent item across mail, calendar and drives combined: everything else in this thread is already past, and this one isn''t.\n\nThe folder also holds `moodboard.pdf` (1,450 bytes) — the deliverable Raj asked for by 25 Sep. Its presence suggests it was produced, though not that it was sent.\n\nWant me to create an event or reminder for the 20 Nov final-files deadline on your Work calendar?"}','assistant','v2','2026-11-22T04:32:25.443Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
