ood news, your order A-42 is on its way. Walnut desk lamp, shipped with Swiftpost. Expected by September 30. Track your package\" — no tracking number. So no tracking number in the email.\n\nI should verify whether there are links/attachments in that email. Body was plain text: \"Track your package\" — a link presumably but not exposed. Maybe I should check the Brightloom shipped email fully — I already have full body (hasContent true, not truncated). So no tracking ID.\n\nCompare: earlier Swiftpost \"on its way\" email and \"delivered\" emails — do they contain tracking numbers? Let me read the A-38 chain emails to compare what information was available for a working delivery. That''s useful: it tells whether Brightloom/Swiftpost normally provides tracking.\n\nSo: read Swiftpost \"on its way\" Aug 1, \"out for delivery\" Aug 4, \"delivered\" Aug 4, and maybe the Apr 20 \"delayed\" one. That gives the shape of tracking info.\n\nDo these reads in parallel — 4 calls.\n\nShould I also search mail for \"tracking\"? I searched \"tracking number\" (0 results). Search just \"tracking\" maybe. Let me include it.\n\nParallel: getEmail x4 + searchMail \"tracking\".\n\nNote the English/Hindi one — irrelevant (Oct 2025, archived).\n\nLet me run."}],"createdAt":1795321953538},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM1N10","from":"Swiftpost","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Your parcel from Brightloom is on its way","date":"Sat Aug 01 2026 07:45:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Parcel SP4471920368PT for Brightloom order A-38: shipped . Expected on August 4. Track your parcel"},"toolCallId":"call_1f594f830c6f4b7499128da7","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM1N10","mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1795321954244},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM2MF0","from":"S