cription invoices, likely paid by card, not visible as bank debits. And Codeyard renewed Feb 2026. Voltaro Energy payment received Mar 2026 & Dec 2025.\n\nNow \"lately\" — nothing since 25 Sep 2026. That''s ~7 weeks of silence. Interesting parallel to A-42.\n\nLet me check whether there are October/November emails at all in the inbox — maybe the bank stopped emailing. Actually the statement cadence: quarterly statements sent 1 Sep covering June–August. Next would be 1 Dec. So a statement gap is expected.\n\nBut zero debit alerts since 25 Sep across all mailing — and the September statement? No, statement for Jun–Aug arrived 1 Sep.\n\nHmm, also worth checking for \"autopay\", \"UPI\", \"withdrawn\", \"paid\". Let me check a couple more terms in Hindi/other: \"डेबिट\" covered by \"Konkan Bank\" search? The Konkan Bank search returned 22 results including the Hindi one. Good — that''s the full bank listing. Note: the Konkan Bank search may be capped at 22... count 22 didn''t hit a limit obviously.\n\nI should read the recent debits'' bodies to identify payees. Let me read: 25 Sep (1,250), 12 Sep (450), 2 Aug (2,760), 19 Jul (3,100). And the latest Ledgerline invoice to get amount (1 Sep, LL-2025111). And Voltaro Mar 2026 payment received.\n\nThat''s 6 reads. Reasonable. Let''s do them in parallel.\n\nIDs:\n- 25 Sep: WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0\n- 12 Sep: WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5MV0\n- 2 Aug: WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM1OF0\n- 19 Jul (Hindi): WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM0N10\n- Ledgerline LL-2025111: WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM3NF0\n- Voltaro Mar 2026: WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDMwOF0\n\nmailboxId: 2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}],"createdAt":1795321958972},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":1,"emails":[{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM0N10","threadId":"<1b7j4hz45g3stsis@konkanbank.in>","from":"Konkan Bank","subject":"खाता **4821 से INR 3,100.00 डेबिट","d