"}]},"toolCallId":"call_e98778625ad44a18afc863ca","toolName":"aggregateInbox","args":{"perMailbox":1}},"updatedAt":1795321961817},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1795321961818,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"So the newest email in the whole mailbox is 26 Sep 2026 — meaning the mailbox has no mail after 26 Sep. Wait, really? That''s odd given today is 15 Nov. But that explains why nothing \"lately\": the mailbox''s most recent message is 26 Sep. Interesting! That''s a strong, concrete finding: the mailbox has been silent for ~7 weeks.\n\nHmm, but earlier the Aozora/brief discussion — brief dated Oct/Nov facts, and calendar events in Nov (Tokyo trip 9–13 Nov). So mail is silent since 26 Sep, though calendar has Nov events.\n\nSo the \"money out lately\" answer: nothing since 25 Sep; and more broadly, the mailbox itself has received nothing since 26 Sep. Let me confirm with per-mailbox check that there''s only one mailbox — aggregateInbox says mailboxes: 1. So single mailbox.\n\nNow read the recent debit bodies for payee context.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"So the newest email in the whole mailbox is 26 Sep 2026 — meaning the mailbox has no mail after 26 Sep. Wait, really? That''s odd given today is 15 Nov. But that explains why nothing \"lately\": the mailbox''s most recent message is 26 Sep. Interesting! That''s a strong, concrete finding: the mailbox has been silent for ~7 weeks.\n\nHmm, but earlier the Aozora/brief discussion — brief dated Oct/Nov facts, and calendar events in Nov (Tokyo trip 9–13 Nov). So mail is silent since 26 Sep, though calendar has Nov events.\n\nSo the \"money out lately\" answer: nothing since 25 Sep; and more broadly, the mailbox itself has received nothing since 26 Sep. Let me confirm with per-mailbox check that there''s only one mailbox — aggregateInbox says mailboxes: 1. So single mailbox.\n\nNow read the recent debit bodies for payee context."}],"createdAt":1