`b4199497-5df2-5d9e-bd43-347298cdaad1` | full drive |\n| s3 | `1ae0b7b1-7ad0-5805-82b9-169bd8978c60` | full drive |\n\nTwo things stand out:\n\n- **No Google Drive or OneDrive.** All seven are server-protocol mounts — FTP (3), S3 (2), SFTP, WebDAV. So this isn''t a personal cloud-drive setup; it''s infrastructure the studio has mounted directly.\n- **One FTP mount is scoped to folders.** `766b212a…` only exposes part of its tree to this workspace. If something you expect isn''t there, that''s the likely reason — and it''s the one drive where \"search every drive\" genuinely won''t cover everything.\n\nThe listing returns no display names, only provider and id, so I can''t tell you *which* FTP host or S3 bucket each one points at without browsing. Want me to open the top level of any of them — or all seven — so you can see what''s actually in each?"}','assistant','v2','2026-11-22T04:33:02.811Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
